      "semantics": [
        "对应于参考语句 x = torch.triu(x)，无 bias，无广播，对每个 batch 和 channel 的最后两维 [128,128] 执行上三角掩码，对角线及上方保留，下方置零。",
        "输入为 CUDA float32 连续张量，输出形状与输入相同，返回新的张量。",
        "实现时需处理批量维度，采用 grid-stride 循环确保所有元素写入。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "batch_norm_eval_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[512, 3, 128, 128]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_mean",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[3]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_var",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[3]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[3]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": true,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[3]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": true,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": 1e-05,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as x"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应于参考语句 x = self.batch_norm(x)，在 eval 模式下使用 running_mean 和 running_var。",
        "计算公式: y = (x - running_mean[c]) / sqrt(running_var[c] + eps) * weight[c] + bias[c]，其中 c 是通道索引。",
        "如果 weight 或 bias 为 None，则分别视为 1 和 0（参考中 affine=True 且均有参数，不为 None）。",
        "输入输出均为 CUDA float32 连续张量，输出形状与输入相同。",
        "eps 为标量双精度，但计算时转为 float32 或直接以 double 参与中间运算。",
        "实现时每个元素独立处理，遍历所有元素并利用通道索引读取对应的 running_mean、running_var、weight、bias。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
